//! Interactive entry point: raw-mode terminal + event loop driving the
//! pi-compatible chat surface.
//!
//! Layout mirrors upstream `createChatViewport`: transcript (scroll view,
//! follows end) above a fixed bottom dock (pending messages → status →
//! widgets-above → editor → widgets-below → footer). Keybindings match the
//! upstream defaults: Enter submit, Shift+Enter newline (bracketed paste /
//! shift detection), Esc interrupt, Ctrl+C clear, Ctrl+D exit, Shift+Tab
//! thinking cycle, Ctrl+P/Shift+Ctrl+P model cycle, Ctrl+L model selector,
//! Ctrl+O tool expand, `!`/`!!` bash mode, `/` commands.

